<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Acer 1996 sales down 8.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Acer 1996 sales down 8.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's computer giant Acer Inc said on Thursday its sales fell 8.0 percent to T$57.944 billion from T$62.984 billion in 1995.</p>
<p>In the month of December, its sales fell 38.3 percent to T$4.425 billion from T$7.173 billion in December 1995, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The statement did not give profit figures, and gave no explanations for the sales drop.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
